## Adding path amplitudes\n\nEach path carries a complex amplitude $a$ or $b$.\n\n$$P = |a + b|^2 = |a|^2 + |b|^2 + 2\\,\\mathrm{Re}(a^* b)$$", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "src-ed653eaa6bca0a1ae76199b5", "revision": "363a18ff401bcf835bdf439f1d8372e9245ab8e8fcbec5a2f941d2a8789e7645", "unit_id": "line-2"}, {"source_id": "src-ed653eaa6bca0a1ae76199b5", "revision": "363a18ff401bcf835bdf439f1d8372e9245ab8e8fcbec5a2f941d2a8789e7645", "unit_id": "line-3"}, {"source_id": "src-ed653eaa6bca0a1ae76199b5", "revision": "363a18ff401bcf835bdf439f1d8372e9245ab8e8fcbec5a2f941d2a8789e7645", "unit_id": "line-4"}]}, "turn_id": "branch:cross-term", "status": "unanswered", "decision": null, "choice": null, "created_at": 1795105972.117008, "replies": [], "conversation": []}}, "attempt": 1, "status": "completed", "text": "Because $|z|^2 = z^* z$, the cross terms give $2\\,\\mathrm{Re}(a^* b)$.\n<teaching-decision>{\"depth\": \"short\", \"category\": \"local\", \"rationale\": \"Local algebra\", \"suggest_supplement\": false, \"supplement_goal\": \"\"}</teaching-decision>", "final_text": "Because $|z|^2 = z^* z$, the cross terms give $2\\,\\mathrm{Re}(a^* b)$.\n<teaching-decision>{\"depth\": \"short\", \"category\": \"local\", \"rationale\": \"Local algebra\", \"suggest_supplement\": false, \"supplement_goal\": \"\"}</teaching-decision>", "sequence": 3, "started_at": 1795105972.1269991, "metrics": {"first_delta_s": 0.012956857681274414, "full_s": 0.03287100791931152, "save_s": 0.0002109769993694499}, "attempts": [], "resume_requests": []}');
